(6204038, 915449, 114969, '<td valign="top">Congratulations for this great work! It was one of my 2 highest votes in this challenge. <br/> <br/>The only concern I have about it is technical: the light on the main subject, that doesn''t seem totally consistent with the rest of the picture. For example, her left palm (right as we look) is lit by a frontal source that is not impacting the pumpkins, which contributes to this "not integrated" feeling. Also, the light on the red dress is probably a bit too strong.<br/> <br/>Other than that, the composition, idea and humor are perfect :-) Oh, and the lightning bolts are awesome. Love it!</td>', 'Congratulations for this great work! It was one of my 2 highest votes in this challenge.  The only concern I have about it is technical: the light on the main subject, that doesn''t seem totally consistent with the rest of the picture. For example, her left palm (right as we look) is lit by a frontal source that is not impacting the pumpkins, which contributes to this "not integrated" feeling. Also, the light on the red dress is probably a bit too strong. Other than that, the composition, idea and humor are perfect :-) Oh, and the lightning bolts are awesome. Love it!', '2010-10-29 02:45:43.000000', NULL, 0),
