(6418461, 915207, 126125, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by duartix:</b></div><hr/><i> Wonderful lighting, setup and make up! The bottom girl expression, as some have said, doesn''t work and I can''t say why! :( At first look it seems as if she''s smiling (which is totally off) even though when the view is rotated she is far from smiling...<br/>Congratulations anyway! </i></td></tr></table> I think it looks like she is uncomfortable. Like she is holding her neck in an awkward way that makes her uncomfortable.</td>', 'Originally posted by duartix: Wonderful lighting, setup and make up! The bottom girl expression, as some have said, doesn''t work and I can''t say why! :( At first look it seems as if she''s smiling (which is totally off) even though when the view is rotated she is far from smiling...Congratulations anyway!  I think it looks like she is uncomfortable. Like she is holding her neck in an awkward way that makes her uncomfortable.', '2011-05-19 14:21:33.000000', NULL, 0),
